@startuml
title Subscription Lifecycle (gemSpec_Kon §4.1.6.5)

[*] --> ACTIVE : Subscribe\n[args valid & access OK]\n/ terminationTime = now+25h

ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : RenewSubscriptions\n[terminationTime > now]\n/ terminationTime = now+25h
ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : delivery success\n/ endpoint.failureCount = 0

ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : terminationTime < now
EXPIRED --> [*] : reaped / excluded from delivery

ACTIVE --> [*] : Unsubscribe\n(by subscriptionId or EventTo)

ACTIVE --> AUTO_UNSUBSCRIBED : endpoint.failureCount\nreaches EVT_MAX_TRY
AUTO_UNSUBSCRIBED --> [*] : cascade delete\n(endpoint + subscriptions)

ACTIVE --> [*] : konnektor restart (bootup)\n[subscriptions cleared;\nendpoint URL retained until retainedUntil]

note right of ACTIVE
  Delivered to only when:
  topic prefix matches (case-insensitive)
  AND access authorised
  AND XPath filter (if any) matches.
end note
@enduml
